: This page is used as a preset summary list for [[wikia:dev:Standard Edit Summary|Standard Edit Summary]].
(click to browse)
1. Refactoring
-- Cleanup
-- Corrected spelling/grammar/typo(s)
-- Factual correction
-- Formatting
-- HTML tidying
-- Wikifying
-- Corrected template usage

2. Content
-- Replaced duplicate image(s)
-- Added/updated cover(s)
-- Added/updated album
-- Added citation
-- Added translation
-- Added/updated/elaborated description
-- Updated trivia
-- Added yt/nnd links
-- Updated with new information
-- Expanded or rewritten
-- Replaced/added YT reprint(s)

3. Removal/Reversion
-- Reverted vandalism, test, or vanity edit(s)
-- Removed fanon or speculative content
-- Removed libel/slander
-- Removed copyright violation(s), including YouTube reprints.
-- Removed material not relating to the topic

4. Templates
-- Added template(s)
-- Added infobox
-- Added disambig template

5. Categories
-- Added category
-- Modified category
-- Alphabetized categories
-- Removed double category

6. Redirects and Shortcuts
-- Added redirect
-- Removed redirect
-- Modified or fixed redirect
-- Added shortcut to article section
-- Removed shortcut to article section

7. Talk Pages and Archives
-- Signing a post
-- Adding a new topic
-- Adding reply on another topic
-- Modifying a topic
-- Removing a topic
-- Archiving or closing a topic
-- Dearchiving a topic